# Portfolio content JSON (optional local overrides)

These filenames are imported by `CareerView.vue` and `ProjectsView.vue`:

- `projects.en.json` / `projects.no.json`
- `education.en.json` / `education.no.json`
- `workExperience.en.json` / `workExperience.no.json`
- `courses.en.json` / `courses.no.json`

They are **gitignored**. Fresh clones and CI use the tracked `*.stub.json` companions via `portfolioJsonFallbackPlugin` in [`vite.portfolio-json-plugin.ts`](../vite.portfolio-json-plugin.ts) (wired from `vite.config.ts`).

Copy the stubs or export from your private vault:

```bash
cp src/types/projects.en.stub.json src/types/projects.en.json
# …then edit with your real content.
```
